    |-----------------------------------------|------------|
    | scripts/score_casda_quality.py           | PASS       |
    | scripts/run_validation_phases.py         | PASS       |
    | scripts/validate_augmented_quality.py    | PASS       |
    | scripts/extract_clean_backgrounds.py     | PASS       |
